error[E0215]: only '.override' may follow 'get' or 'set'
 --> $DIR/final.nra:3:11
  |
3 |     | get.final: instance;
  |           ^^^^^ expected 'override', found 'final'
  |
  = help: a class hook clause is '| get: <expression>;' or '| set: { ... };'

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0215`.
